  "policy": "This manifest is the single source of truth for which Xiranite nodes survive the Rust/Tauri rewrite. A node covered by a more specialized standalone project is not re-implemented and gets no Extism plugin. Nodes listed as hold-unmigrated must stay in xiranite.build.toml nodes.disabled and must not be deleted or rewritten this round. Retained nodes carry a wasmFeasibility verdict produced by the AST dependency audit, never by node name. bun run audit:target-node-manifest fails when this file, xiranite.build.toml and packages/nodes drift apart.",
